    "title": "Support multi-account Cloudflare ingress sync by deriving account_ids from tunnel tokens",
    "body": "The original sync only queried a single account via `cloudflared tunnel list`, which missed tunnels belonging to other accounts configured in the same setup. The fix decodes each configured tunnel's base64 token to extract its account_id, then fetches ingress routes per-account, trying all available API credentials (cert.pem and cf_api_token) against each one. This generalizes the tool to work correctly for users managing tunnels across multiple Cloudflare accounts instead of assuming a single-account context.",
